# =========================
# Run artefacts — ALL consolidated into profiling_reports/ on 2026-09-18.
# Nothing named h27*/ prod_runs_*/ box_*/ etc. lives at the repo root any more;
# those patterns are kept only so a fresh box-pull lands ignored by default.
#
# NOTE profiling_reports/ is ignored, but 66 files inside it ARE tracked
# (h229_2026_09_12, h227_2026_09_11, cublas_rev_eng_binary/*.md). .gitignore
# never untracks an already-tracked file, so they keep syncing. Do not "fix"
# this by unignoring the folder — that would add ~1150 files / 229 MB.
# =========================
profiling_reports/
h27y*/
h27z*/
h186*/
h192*/
h211*/
h227*/
h229*/
prod_runs_*/
kota_backtrack_*/
box_rescue_*/
box_src/
blutrain_prod_local/
flux_bin_data/
mini_blutrain/
numpy_tests/
pytorch_tests/
libtorch_tests/
test_prep/
scripts/

