# =========================
# Documentation mirror — MUST stay tracked.
# work_docs/ holds byte-identical copies of blublas/docs/*.md (master) plus
# sft_work_documentation.md. The blanket *.log / *.bak rules above do not
# touch .md, but pin it explicitly so nobody adds a broad *.md rule later.
# =========================
!work_docs*/**/*.md
!work_docs*/*.md

